Package: fmristore
Type: Package
Title: Efficient Storage of fMRI Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Bradley",
           family = "Buchsbaum",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "brad.buchsbaum@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1108-4866"))
Description: Stores 'fmridataset' frames in HDF5. Single-file snapshots are
    written atomically and reopened lazily, sharded stores accept appended
    observations without rewriting earlier data, interrupted writes can be
    recovered, and HDF5 datasets are exposed as lazy array sources.
